# Screenshot assets for README.md (and any future docs).
#
# Each path referenced by README.md must have a real PNG here, or the
# README renders broken-image icons. Maintainers should drop fresh
# captures from a real DSH Web session into the matching path and commit.
#
# Required (referenced by README.md):
#   settings-logged-in.png   — Settings → MiniMax OAuth panel, post-login state
#   browser-authorize.png    — MiniMax browser authorization page (user_code entry)
